      209.1,
      437.08,
      378.89,
      450.92
    ],
    "text": "Order under Subsection (2) of Section 2",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.01,
      461.24,
      542.52,
      510.71
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by subsection (2) of section 2 of the Fauna and Flora Protection Ordinance (Chapter 469), I, Hettithanthri Patabendige Dammika, Minister of Environment do by this Order declare the area of land described in the Schedule hereto to be a Sanctuary for the purposes of the aforesaid Ordinance and further declare that such Sanctuary shall be known as the \u201cNikkandupola Sanctuary\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.01,
      521.24,
      524.72,
      570.71
    ],
    "text": "Hettithanthri Patabendige Dammika, Minister of Environment.Colombo,04th June, 2025.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
