      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.02,
      629.24,
      542.51,
      690.71
    ],
    "text": "All that area of land depicted in the map of the Department of Wildlife Conservation dated 02/05/2025, containing in extent 13.14 hectares, situated within the streamflow, stream banks and riparian corridors of the stream flowed from Rabbidigala to Hapugoda in the Village of Nikkandupola, Galapitamada in the Warakapola Divisional Secretary's Division in the Administrative District of Kegalle in the Sabaragamuwa Province and bounded by the GPS Coordinates specified hereunder, (Mode of Survey: GPS Coordinates EPSG: 5234):-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
